  "details": "Jenkins 2.587 and earlier, LTS 2.580.1 and earlier allows requests authenticated using HTTP Basic authentication, including with an API token, to obtain a \"remember me\" cookie, allowing attackers who have obtained a user's API token to retain access to Jenkins using a \"remember me\" cookie after the API token is revoked or expires.",
